# R3.1 computed-style snapshot directory
#
# Populated at runtime by `scripts/capture_all_button_snapshots.py`.
# Each file is `<brand_slug>.json` carrying a `ComputedStyleReport`
# (see `extractor/computed_styles.py`). Consumed by
# `app/library_indexer.py::_load_button_tokens` for the Hybrid Path B
# button-fidelity override (CTO 2026-06-02).
#
# Snapshots are environment artifacts, not source. The directory itself
# is tracked (this file) so the path resolves; populate snapshots via
# the capture CLI per OPS.md section 8.
